Pattern inventory lives in [ark-interaction-pattern-library-v1.md](../../docs/ecosystem/ark-interaction-pattern-library-v1.md). Patterns are first-class identities; products are evidence. Review notes under `docs/ecosystem/reviews/`. Do **not** expand the frozen doctrine with pattern lists.

